      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788653786466,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n1. put(key, value) - write or overwrite\n2. get(key) - get the current value of the key. Return multiple sibling versions on conflicts \n3. delete(key)  - Delete via tombstone\n4. Versioning - Support causality tracking ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n1. put(key, value) - write or overwrite\n2. get(key) - get the current value of the key. Return multiple sibling versions on conflicts \n3. delete(key)  - Delete via tombstone\n4. Versioning - Support causality tracking ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9bLu58Rpc2txrQKtF4zyZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 617.511474609375,
      "y": 894.7461547851562,
      "width": 747.8473510742186,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1681589813,
      "version": 442,
      "versionNonce": 343779975,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788653789173,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-Functional:\n\nAvailability - High - Allow write/read even on partition\nConsistency - Tunable (High, low, eventual by default)\nDurability - No data loss after successful write\nLatency - P99 < 10ms - For a single key write within the same key or region\nScale - Billion of keys - Horizontally scalable\nNode - Every node can coordinate",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-Functional:\n\nAvailability - High - Allow write/read even on partition\nConsistency - Tunable (High, low, eventual by default)\nDurability - No data loss after successful write\nLatency - P99 < 10ms - For a single key write within the same key or region\nScale - Billion of keys - Horizontally scalable\nNode - Every node can coordinate",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
