      "updated": 1788653826946,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Virtual Nodes (vnodes)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Virtual Nodes (vnodes)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "EhKhg1LmyLicrwKISANXq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 672.8070583131137,
      "y": 2537.3858868902457,
      "width": 1223.2829052649008,
      "height": 25.536084005339724,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 316239611,
      "version": 295,
      "versionNonce": 167451655,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788653826946,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A single node failure dumps its entire range onto exactly one neighbor. ==> Data are disproportionately distributed",
      "fontSize": 20.42886720427178,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A single node failure dumps its entire range onto exactly one neighbor. ==> Data are disproportionately distributed",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "YdeGTO5_C_-S74JLuqFlT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 673.0460527444967,
      "y": 2621.929743926845,
      "width": 2028.877197265625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1971336571,
      "version": 34,
      "versionNonce": 2077871081,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788653826946,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Virtual nodes give you: even load distribution, faster/parallelized recovery after a node failure (many nodes each take a small slice, not one node taking it all), and easy heterogeneous capacity (give a bigger node more vnodes).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Virtual nodes give you: even load distribution, faster/parallelized recovery after a node failure (many nodes each take a small slice, not one node taking it all), and easy heterogeneous capacity (give a bigger node more vnodes).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "i3_8OAchLXwby-FFC2sKx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560.2548860304006,
      "y": 2694.4220545514263,
      "width": 490.6593933105469,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 195744405,
      "version": 196,
      "versionNonce": 543687463,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788653826946,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Replication factor => N\n- Synchronous => Wait for all N Node\n- Asynchronous => Wait for 1 node not all N\n- Quorum => W + R > n = (wait for W of N) = Eventual\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Replication factor => N\n- Synchronous => Wait for all N Node\n- Asynchronous => Wait for 1 node not all N\n- Quorum => W + R > n = (wait for W of N) = Eventual\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "LOwQ7OYCpbIlQn5VZ3M_0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 559.161950019134,
      "y": 2809.2043452056637,
      "width": 711.5590209960938,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1547934133,
      "version": 61,
      "versionNonce": 2087347913,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788653826946,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Each key is replicated to N nodes (typically N=3) drawn from its preference list.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Each key is replicated to N nodes (typically N=3) drawn from its preference list.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
