      "updated": 1788646807404,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Availability => should available even in network partitioning\nLatency => P99 < 10 ms\nScale => 100K IDs / Sec\nUniqueness => Zero Collusion\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Availability => should available even in network partitioning\nLatency => P99 < 10 ms\nScale => 100K IDs / Sec\nUniqueness => Zero Collusion\n",
