      "text": "Pros:\n - Zero co-ordination\n- No Single point of failure\n- Simple ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Pros:\n - Zero co-ordination\n- No Single point of failure\n- Simple ",
